>218</volume><year>1995</year><fpage>223</fpage><lpage>232</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7737361</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="Rijkenetal1998"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Rijken</surname><given-names>P.J.</given-names></name><name><surname>van Hal</surname><given-names>G.J.</given-names></name><name><surname>van der Heyden</surname><given-names>M.A.</given-names></name><name><surname>Verkleij</surname><given-names>A.J.</given-names></name><name><surname>Boonstra</surname><given-names>J.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Actin polymerization is required for negative feedback regulation of epidermal growth factor-induced signal transduction</article-title><source>Exp. Cell Res.</source><volume>243</volume><year>1998</year><fpage>254</fpage><lpage>262</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9743585</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="Rochlinetal1989"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Rochlin</surname><given-names>M.W.</given-names></name><name><surname>Chen</surname><given-names>Q.</given-names></name><name><surname>Tobler</surname><given-names>M.</given-names></name><name><surname>Turner</surname><given-names>C.E.</given-names></name><name><surname>Burridge</surname><given-names>K.</given-names></name><name><surname>Peng</surname><given-names>H.B.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The relationship between talin and acetylcholine receptor clusters in <italic>Xenopus</italic> muscle cells</article-title><source>J. Cell Sci.</source><volume>92</volume><year>1989</year><fpage>461</fpage><lpage>472</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">2512307</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="Rochlinetal1999"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Rochlin</surname><given-names>M.W.</given-names></name><name><surname>Dailey</surname><given-names>M.E.</given-names></name><name><surname>Bridgman</s